Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add Groq AI chat, hash passwords, fix settings UI

- backend: add /api/chat endpoint (Groq Llama 3, free tier) with full
  financial context injected into system prompt
- backend: add groq>=0.9.0 to requirements.txt
- auth.js: hash passwords with SHA-256 via crypto.subtle before storing;
  auto-migrate existing plaintext passwords on next login
- ai-integration.js: add GroqChat module with context-aware chat,
  message history, typing indicator, and API key management
- index.html: add floating AI chat button + slide-in chat panel,
  add Groq API key field in Settings, fix unclosed div tags in
  settings page, show/hide chat button based on auth state

